 "_spec": "covenant@2:297ca24fdcef",
 "content": [
  {
   "signature": "",
   "thinking": "",
   "type": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "text": "{\"recommendation\":\"escalate\",\"explanation\":\"Minimum Unrestricted Cash at October 31, 2026 fails. The bank calculated {{fact:72314421-976e-4db8-8c1a-54edfb96cefd}} against a minimum of {{fact:90263cfa-801d-4997-8049-daccf4de5980}} ({{fact:420db624-0e32-49de-bd64-e9d3d4a80144}} headroom). The certificate reports {{fact:20e82f95-f192-4d3b-ad4b-4c408e3fa3fc}} and claims compliance. Its covenant schedule reaches that figure by adding the pledged collateral account to cash in the operating accounts. The agreement's definition of Unrestricted Cash excludes pledged or restricted cash. The October bank statement marks the collateral account as restricted and pledged to secure a letter of credit. The operating accounts match the bank's input of {{fact:797f7e18-b0f4-47b4-9561-fc9d6bb7c7f8}}. No amendment or other terms version is on file. A rerun under the approved terms confirms the failure ({{fact:f282febe-1b1c-4211-9b10-ddb383ae3a58}} against {{fact:2b63e6cf-de10-48e5-913f-3e37b8ee0e1c}}). The Series B term sheet is non-binding and closes after the test date, so it does not affect this test. The certificate's arithmetic error explains why it differs from the bank's figure, and the breach appears real.\",\"claims\":[{\"text\":\"Unrestricted Cash excludes cash that is pledged, escrowed or otherwise restricted.\",\"document_id\":\"2fabe794-3887-41f6-bc69-6654ea52676d\",\"page\":3,\"quote\":\"\\\"Unrestricted Cash\\\" means cash held in deposit accounts of the Borrower with\\nthe Lender, excluding any cash that is pledged, escrowed or otherwise restricted.\"},{\"text\":\"Section 6.1 sets the minimum Unrestricted Cash at each month end.\",\"document_id\":\"2fabe794-3887-41f6-bc69-6654ea52676d\",\"page\":4,\"quote\":\"6.1 Minimum Unrestricted Cash. Unrestricted Cash shall not be less than $5,000,000 at any month\\nend.\"},{\"text\":\"The certificate's covenant schedule counts cash in the pledged collateral account toward Unrestricted Cash.\",\"document_id\":\"e4aa3c5c-7d9c-4083-a826-52f926e300bc\",\"page\":2,\"quote\":\"Cash held in the pledged collateral account\"},{\"text\":\"The October bank statement shows the collateral account as restricted and pledged.\",\"document_id\":\"5cfd8949-4073-4e46-a7c0-10823570ccd7\",\"page\":1,\"quote\":\"The collateral account is pledged to secure a hosting lease letter of credit. Balances in restricted accounts are not available for\\nwithdrawal.\"},{\"text\":\"The Series B extension term sheet is non-binding.\",\"document_id\":\"4c56d3c8-7d99-43ff-b73b-56cf227ef818\",\"page\":1,\"quote\":\"This summary is non-binding except for confidentiality.\"}],\"calc_ids\":[\"42b95c3d-e261-4df8-8225-9c03419e5211\",\"0ec6fb8f-8994-4024-870d-4810481c3aa3\"],\"missing_evidence\":[],\"suggested_tag\":\"borrower_calc_error\"}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
